OL,2,V55555555CCOLLETTE: MAN
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CON MURDER CHARGE
OL,4,Q
OL,5, A man has been charged with the murder
OL,6, of six-year-old Collette Gallacher.
OL,8, Adam George Stein, 26, of Corby,
OL,9, Northants, was remanded in custody for
OL,10, eight days by local magistrates.
OL,12, He appeared in court with both wrists
OL,13, and forearms heavily bandaged.
OL,15, Collette's body was found hidden in an
OL,16, attic in a house near her Corby home on
OL,17, Tuesday evening.
OL,18,Q
OL,19, She went missing on her way to school
OL,20, last Friday.
OL,23,F]DFrom 06-03-96 / teletextarchive.com
