OL,2,V55555555CLIVERPOOL: ONE-DAY
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CSTRIKE TOMORROW
OL,4,Q
OL,5, Liverpool Council shop stewards have
OL,6, abandoned their call for an indefinite
OL,7, strike backing the city's rate rebels.
OL,9, Instead they are to hold a one-day
OL,10, protest strike tomorrow - a decision
OL,11, made after four major unions refused
OL,12, to back an indefinite strike.
OL,14, Meanwhile, auditors are to consider
OL,15, more action against the 80 councillors
OL,16, surcharged and banned from office for
OL,17, not setting a rate on time.
OL,19, More penalties could follow for the
OL,20, long-term effects of the rates delay
OL,21, in Liverpool and Lambeth.
OL,23,F]DFrom 06-03-86 / teletextarchive.com
