OL,2,V55555555CBR PUTTING ON
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CTHE RITZ
OL,5, Train travellers are to be offered the
OL,6, "Ritz of the Rails" in a major catering
OL,7, shake-up announced by BR.
OL,9, Venison and grouse will be on offer at
OL,10, the top end of the range while
OL,11, vegetarian lasagne and "interesting"
OL,12, sandwiches will also be on the menu.
OL,14, BR is spending #12m in the next year on
OL,15, the service to the West Midlands, North
OL,16, West and Scotland. It starts on Monday
OL,17, on the London to Manchester line.
OL,19, BR's new retail and catering manager
OL,20, David Sumner said the aim was to
OL,21, provide the best of all possible worlds
OL,23,F]DFrom 06-03-96 / teletextarchive.com
