OL,1,V7w3s7s35E                         G8/44
OL,2,V55555555CKILLER TOYS CALL
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CAT BOY'S INQUEST
OL,4,B
OL,5, New powers to keep killer toys out of
OL,6, Britain were urged at the inquest on
OL,7, a boy of five who died after swallowing
OL,8, nylon hairs from a furry musical pony.
OL,10, West Yorkshire coroner Philip Gill
OL,11, called for a body to be set up to
OL,12, check such imports as they come in.
OL,14, He said such monitoring might help to
OL,15, prevent "this sort of tragedy from
OL,16, happening again".
OL,18, He recorded a misadventure verdict on
OL,19, Alexander Kettlewell, of Leeds, who
OL,20, died when the hairs collected behind
OL,21, his nose causing brain damage.
OL,23,F]DFrom 06-03-96 / teletextarchive.com
