OL,2,V55555555CFIVE SHOT DEAD IN
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CATTACK ON SIKH LEADER
OL,4,B
OL,5, Five people were shot dead and 14 more
OL,6, were injured when gunmen in a speeding
OL,7, Jeep tried to assassinate a moderate
OL,8, Sikh leader in India.
OL,10, The six gunmen opened fire on Mr Kabul
OL,11, Singh as he drove through Kapurtha in
OL,12, the northern Punjab on his way back
OL,13, from a meeting with a militant faction.
OL,15, Police said that most of the dead and
OL,16, injured were bystanders, but Mr Singh's
OL,17, bodyguard was among those killed. Mr
OL,18, Singh suffered only minor wounds.
OL,20, Police imposed an immediate curfew and
OL,21, rushed reinforcements to the area.
OL,23,F]DFrom 06-03-96 / teletextarchive.com
