OL,2,Q+.!+.!/$/      C    TORRANCE SETS    Qj
OL,3,Q5GMALAYSIAN OPEN  C   THE PACE       Qj
OL,4,Q#######################################
OL,5,FBritain's Sam Torrance fired a four-
OL,6,Funder-par 67 to lead after the first
OL,7,Fround by one stroke.
OL,8,F
OL,9,FThe Ryder Cup Scot said that he also
OL,10,Fmissed birdie chances on the first
OL,11,Fthree holes but it was still "a good
OL,12,Fstart" in Kuala Lumpur.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FHe picked up a #700 prize for firing
OL,15,Fthe best round of the day.
OL,16,F
OL,17,FTied for second spot are Australian
OL,18,FBrian Jones, Lu Chien-Soon of Taiwan
OL,19,Fand Hidenori Nakajima of Japan.
OL,20,F
OL,21,FThe three also have a one-shot lead
OL,22,Fover a group on 69. C
OL,23,Q]GFrom 06-03-86 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
