CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1772832103
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0     G35/44
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,4,F
OL,5, NATO and the Warsaw Pact have proposed
OL,6, large cuts in conventional weapons at
OL,7, arms talks in Vienna.
OL,9,FBoth sides agreed at the Conventional
OL,10,FForces in Europe talks that imbalances
OL,11,Fin weapons should be eliminated.
OL,13,FThe proposals were presented by Foreign
OL,14,FSecretary Sir Geoffrey Howe and Soviet
OL,15,Fforeign minister Mr Eduard Shevardnadze
OL,17,FSir Geoffrey suggested cuts of five to
OL,18,F10 per cent in tanks, artillery and
OL,19,Ftroop carriers. Mr Shevardnadze wanted
OL,20,Fsimilar cuts but said troops, aircraft
OL,21,Fand helicopters must also be discussed.
OL,23,T]CFrom 06-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,497,190,120,250,0,100
PN,49636
SC,0036
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1772832103
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0     G36/44
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, The families of three IRA members shot
OL,6, dead by soldiers in Gibraltar have
OL,7, announced they are to take legal action
OL,8, against the Government.
OL,10,FMr Niall Farrell, whose sister Mairead
OL,11,Fwas one of those who died, said a case
OL,12,Falleging unlawful killing would be
OL,13,Fbrought in the civil courts.
OL,15,FHe said the case would begin in six
OL,16,Fweeks, and if necessary would be taken
OL,17,Fto the European Court of Human Rights.
OL,19,FThe two others who were killed on the
OL,20,FRock a year ago today were Danny McCann
OL,21,Fand Sean Savage.
OL,23,T]CFrom 06-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
